---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Reta" description="Who we are and why we exist.">
  <article class="prose-reta px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl">About Reta</h1>

    <p>Reta is a small, independent publication about dating for grown-ups. We cover three audiences mainstream dating media often ignores:</p>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>Mature singles (40+)</strong> getting back into dating after a divorce, loss, or long pause.</li>
      <li><strong>Body-positive singles</strong> who deserve platforms that treat them like full humans.</li>
      <li><strong>Locals</strong> who want to meet someone in their actual city, not on a global feed.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Our promise</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Real talk, no panic-marketing.</li>
      <li>Every sponsored link is labelled.</li>
      <li>If a partner gets shady, we drop them, even when payouts are high.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we make money</h2>
    <p>Affiliate commissions when readers sign up for services we recommend. Read our full <a href="/disclaimer/">disclosure</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
